<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts Canadian telecoms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill starts Canadian telecoms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said its analyst Glen Cambell started BCE Mobile Communications Inc as a near-term accumulate and a long-term buy and Clearnet Communications Inc, also as near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said its Canadian telecoms analyst also assumed coverage of Rogers Cantel and maintained the near-term neutral and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
</text>
